# 统一换行符处理，避免 Windows/Linux/macOS 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确按二进制处理，防止 Git 尝试转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.psd binary
*.cwproj binary

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 文本文件显式声明
*.py   text diff=python
*.md   text diff=markdown
*.txt  text
*.json text
